<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>RAMpig — Find what's eating your RAM</title>
  <meta name="description" content="RAMpig sniffs out macOS memory hogs. One curl command, paste into any LLM, get a plain-language diagnosis.">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🐷</text></svg>">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap');

    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --pink: #ff6b9d;
      --pink-dim: #ff6b9d88;
      --green: #39ff14;
      --green-dim: #39ff1444;
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: #12121a;
      --text: #e0dfe6;
      --text-dim: #6a6880;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Scanline overlay */
    body::after {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        transparent,
        transparent 2px,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 2px,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 4px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    /* Grid background */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(var(--pink-dim) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink-dim) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 60px 60px;
      opacity: 0.04;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    main {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 620px;
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .pig {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--pink);
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--pink-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    h1 .ram {
      color: var(--pink);
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--pink-dim);
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .terminal {
      background: #0c0c14;
      border: 1px solid #1e1e2a;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 1px #1a1a24,
        0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 60px -10px var(--pink-dim);
      transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
    }

    .terminal:hover {
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 1px #252530,
        0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 80px -10px var(--pink-dim);
    }

    .terminal-titlebar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
      background: #101018;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a24;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .terminal-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .terminal-dot.red { background: #ff5f57; }
    .terminal-dot.yellow { background: #febc2e; }
    .terminal-dot.green { background: #28c840; }

    .terminal-title {
      flex: 1;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-right: 42px;
    }

    .terminal-body {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    }

    .terminal-body code {
      flex: 1;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--green);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--green-dim);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow-x: auto;
      user-select: all;
      -webkit-user-select: all;
    }

    .terminal-body code .prompt {
      color: var(--pink);
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
    }

    .terminal-body code .pipe {
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .copy-btn {
      background: #16161f;
      border: 1px solid #252530;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: color 0.15s, background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-left: 0.8rem;
    }

    .copy-btn:hover {
      color: var(--pink);
      background: #1c1c28;
      border-color: #353540;
    }

    .copy-btn svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .copy-btn .check { display: none; }
    .copy-btn.copied .clipboard { display: none; }
    .copy-btn.copied .check { display: block; color: var(--green); }
    .copy-btn.copied { border-color: #39ff1444; }

    .footnote {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .footnote a {
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }

    .footnote a:hover {
      color: var(--pink);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="pig">🐷</div>
    <h1><span class="ram">RAM</span>pig</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Sniff out what's hogging your Mac's memory. Oink.</p>
    <div class="terminal">
      <div class="terminal-titlebar">
        <div class="terminal-dot red"></div>
        <div class="terminal-dot yellow"></div>
        <div class="terminal-dot green"></div>
        <span class="terminal-title">Terminal</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body">
        <code><span class="prompt">$ </span>curl -s renard.cool/rampig.sh <span class="pipe">|</span> bash</code>
        <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCmd(this)" aria-label="Copy to clipboard">
          <!-- Lucide: copy -->
          <svg class="clipboard" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg>
          <!-- Lucide: check -->
          <svg class="check" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="footnote">macOS only &middot; scans memory, copies snapshot to clipboard, paste into any LLM</p>
  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    function copyCmd(btn) {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText('curl -s renard.cool/rampig.sh | bash');
      btn.classList.add('copied');
      setTimeout(() => btn.classList.remove('copied'), 2000);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
